    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's design an innovative AI solution that meets these requirements? our company's can design an innovative AI solution that meets the client's requirements. our company's has experience with large language models, including Mistral 7B, which is our company's preferred sovereign model due to Mistral 7B, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance and EU origin strong performance and EU origin. our company's have also developed expertise in Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, allowing our company's to provide accurate and relevant information to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve the required response time of under 2.0 seconds, our company's can utilize our company's quantisation methods, such as INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), which reduce the model size while maintaining comparable task performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would enable our company's to deploy a model that meets the client's performance requirements. our company's fine-tuning methods, including LoRA and QLoRA, can be applied to adapt the model to the client's specific domain and tone, ensuring high-quality responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's explainability tools, such as source citation (RAG grounding) and SHAP for classification models, would provide transparency into the decision-making process of the AI solution. our company's have a proven track record of delivering successful AI solutions in various domains, including public administration, which aligns with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, our company's previous use case in regulatory document Q&A assistant demonstrates our company's ability to design and deploy effective AI-powered solutions for administrative tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, our company's can leverage our company's experience with vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, and pgvector, allowing our company's to efficiently store and retrieve relevant information. our company's RAG capabilities would facilitate the consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, analysis and processing of files, and recall of applicable rules." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining Our RAG capabilities and tailoring Our RAG capabilities to the client's specific needs, our company's can design an innovative AI solution that meets the requirements for high availability, response time, and functionality, while also ensuring explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires the solution to contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption, rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact, and demonstrate capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's provide a sustainable solution that meets The client environmental requirements? our company's can provide a sustainable solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact. our company's has an EcoVadis rating of Silver with a score of 62, indicating our company's commitment to sustainability. our company's have a total scope 1 and 2 greenhouse gas emission of 148 tCO2e as of 2023, and our company's aim to reach net zero by 2040. our company's partner with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy and have an ISO14001 certification. our company's digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our company's strive for innovation, our company's capacity for innovation in the context of sustainability is tied to our company's existing practices and partnerships. our company's can offer solutions that incorporate energy-efficient technologies and minimize waste, aligning with Our digital sobriety practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, specific details about how our company's solution will contribute to reducing energetic consumption or our solution exact carbon footprint are not available within my current context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, based on our company's profile and commitments, our company's are well-positioned to provide a sustainable solution that meets the client's environmental requirements, leveraging our company's green hosting partnerships, digital sobriety practices, and ongoing efforts to reduce our carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company proposes an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service aims at facilitating access to information, reducing processing times, and providing high-level availability compatible with the needs of municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company approach optimizes costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a global budget of 3 million euros over a period of 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company will deploy an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service in a progressive manner, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and followed by a progressive generalization to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company solution integrates with existing practices of agents, does not constitute a rupture in agents modes of work, and provides an intelligent assistance tool accessible from agents work environment. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment assists with consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, analysis, and processing of files. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment also proposes relevant information, recalls applicable rules, and suggests actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company guarantee explainability and transparency of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service, ensuring that it will be possible a posteriori to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The decision-making process shall not be made automatically without explicit validation of an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company solution complies with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensures data protection through encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The hosting of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service must be located in a SecNumCloud type or equivalent infrastructure, with particular attention brought to dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers." ;
